{
    "background_story": "Lucca was a skilled esthetician with a passion for helping her clients feel confident in their own skin. She specialized in the art of epilation, using her expertise to remove unwanted hair from even the most sensitive areas. Lucca's gentle touch and soothing demeanor put her clients at ease, making the sometimes-painful process almost enjoyable. Her attention to detail and commitment to perfection earned her a loyal following among the fashion-conscious crowd. From brow shaping to full-body waxing, Lucca's epilation skills were unmatched. She took pride in empowering her clients to feel smooth, silky, and radiant, both inside and out. With Lucca, the art of epilation was not just a treatment, but a transformative experience.",
